This paper investigates the normalized ground state solution for the given biharmonic Choquard type equation \begin{align*}
  \begin{split}
  \Delta^2u + \frac{N-4}{2}u^p=\frac{I_{\mathbb{R}^N}((\mathbb{R}^N\times\mathbb{R}^N)\nyl{u})^{\frac{p+2}{2}}}{\|u\|_{L^2(\mathbb{R}^N)\nyl{u}^p+2}^2},
  \end{split}
  \end{align*} where $N\geq6$ and $p>\frac{6}{3-2\frac{N}{4}}$.
